        "problem": "The bar chart has five faint gridlines but no numeric tick labels, so the 40-vs-16 comparison can only be taken on trust; the only unit cue is the \"Median (hours)\" header line.",
        "correction": "Add light numeric axis ticks (for example 0, 20, 40 hours) along the gridlines, or label the axis end points, so the magnitude of the drop is verifiable at a glance. This is a scene/chart setting only; do not alter the data labels or source markers.",
